{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "7e28b7b45753fc06b444453cd7c21604b09812c555d56d925acf990a6b20f5d4", "ja": "妖精たちの競演", "zh": "妖精们的竞演", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "33004420851d37371a17401496eedf889a2baed2bf9b5c1639c3cd002f7ada26", "ja": "Fairyチーム公演でオープニングナンバー\nを任されることになった静香、恵美、志保、\nジュリア、紬の5人。今回の公演の\n『FAIRY STARS』として公演を成功\nさせようと、それぞれ決意を固める。", "zh": "静香、惠美、志保、茱莉亚和䌷五个人\n将在Fairy队公演中担任开场成员。\n她们各自下定决心，要当好本次公演的\n『FAIRY STARS』，让演出圆满落幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1000_015siz", "source_sha256": "5ced843e00c6f29d335e4b72360f884ea0c7ec00ff03c2e0ca1e26e0734c7e40", "ja": "ええええ～っ！？（え？）", "zh": "咦咦咦咦～！？（咦？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1001_020meg", "source_sha256": "a751daef50396b9cf66411594a65eda384516be5de5c7b8837464476a829b114", "ja": "ええええ～っ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦咦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1002_050jul", "source_sha256": "a751daef50396b9cf66411594a65eda384516be5de5c7b8837464476a829b114", "ja": "ええええ～っ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦咦～！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1004_033sih", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1005_020meg", "source_sha256": "a59c7106bc103d6f895fb3f5325d8518b6b05619fc33f720f0d4f52c67d36138", "ja": "ま……まってみんな！　落ち着こう？\nこれって、いいこと、なんだよね……？", "zh": "等……等等啊，各位！冷静点！\n这应该是件好事吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1006_033sih", "source_sha256": "7685a910247c63bb7319ec438afdb1a7750332d3f67ebeb3a34da327bb7de701", "ja": "そうですね。\n慌てることでもないと思いますし。", "zh": "的确如此。\n我想并不是什么需要惊慌的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "b161a388da4e53496a6a4fc413840423e92e1fb1e0bb8165a4386cb9356440b0", "ja": "そうだな。\nこのメンバーなら、しっかりやり遂げられるはずだ。", "zh": "是啊。\n要是有这些成员，一定可以顺利完成的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1008_051tmg", "source_sha256": "1adee0b2038c4b15665b7b7d89a566db9b9eda25cd6289417b7687adb9f3b8dc", "ja": "では、本当に……。", "zh": "那么，真的是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "26c02f9b406f1d337deab511d20f3c4c0e4a7e139c3fdb0ac40a0fc1b49c2a8b", "ja": "ウチら、5人が……？", "zh": "我们五个人……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1010_015siz", "source_sha256": "3f894d9b1e9f5c6bc8ede03bb28b9f924db21d83144cef5906085393c805b9da", "ja": "さっき集まったFairyチームの、\n選抜メンバー……なんですか？", "zh": "我们是刚刚聚集的Fairy队的\n选拔成员……是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a01d4d2091adbee1d3fefa541b885b840718b5391f5c6a3cf430dcfc793654dc", "ja": "ああ。今回はこの5人が、Fairyチームのための\n新曲を歌う『FAIRY STARS』だ！", "zh": "是啊，这次你们五个人就是\n要演唱Fairy队专属新歌的『FAIRY STARS』！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1012_p", "source_sha256": "4a063c0b906b4e5a360fdfb866619c1bc937171ccac07e35efae204646d957be", "ja": "お披露目公演のトップバッターとして、最初に\n歌ってもらうことになるからな。しっかり頼んだぞ！", "zh": "你们要为首次亮相公演打头阵，\n最先上台演唱，就万事拜托啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "ab8f8aa3963874d40bd20bc540e68136eac0423276e543c5ebcdbec7580d37ef", "ja": "マジかよ……！\nくぅ～、テンション上がってきたぜ！", "zh": "真的假的……！\n呼～我开始兴奋了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "20b6c21fb52b66a9b48623fad24cee4c4e90fa7f26a4f9e5d046c07262ced208", "ja": "今、やっと実感が……半分くらい湧いて来ました。\n絶対に、最高のステージにしてみせます！", "zh": "现在终于觉得……有大概一半的踏实感了。\n我们一定会完成最棒的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1015_020meg", "source_sha256": "8f8ef980e8b3a8c21e03e21cbe779528d1899d727c188d00634a925f854bb960", "ja": "にゃはは♪　今から公演が楽しみだな～。\nね、志保、紬！　ワクワクしちゃうよねっ♪", "zh": "呀哈哈♪现在就开始期待公演了呢～\n对不对，志保、䌷！很兴奋期待吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "e26836de05ad809130b583bf7fb8b364f2c5a48cfd03a95eea1c66db0c413d39", "ja": "ワク……、まあ、チャンスだとは思います。\n選ばれた以上、成功させてみせます。", "zh": "兴奋……好吧，我认为是个机会。\n既然被选中了，就一定要让公演成功。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1017_051tmg", "source_sha256": "23ee75cd343600faf9952934acec45ea101ef0a14430d2a65b760b1384a98628", "ja": "今さらどこかに隠れるわけにもいきません。\nお客さま方に満足していただけるよう……頑張ります。", "zh": "事到如今，也不能躲了。\n我会努力……让各位观众能够满足。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "018ecc6dbf041e065139e328a8bdc3b60f256fe4441804daf126530d0c185f81", "ja": "みんな、やる気は十分だな。それじゃ、\nこの5人で歌う新曲を、今から聴いてみよう！", "zh": "大家都很有干劲呢，那现在就\n来听听你们五个人要演唱的新歌吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1020_020meg", "source_sha256": "6c38ad6140d6172692a4d72abc14983e1030286a189469e2b2824d3750e87dc2", "ja": "わあ、メッチャカッコイイね！\nアタシ、この曲好きだな～♪", "zh": "哇啊，超级帅气呢！\n我喜欢这首歌～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "588dc94332e4d5e43bfe78796a332b64becae5c97a03c993aec9b867152ceddc", "ja": "だよなっ！　あたしも、ロックを感じた。\nコイツは絶対、アツいステージになる！", "zh": "对吧！我也感受到了摇滚精神，\n这绝对会是场气氛热烈的表演！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "2a230f60fe37fe1005403e41c6ad67fb4ca45f654736a6d8b0f701d0f649a562", "ja": "それって、ちゃんと歌えればの話ですよね。\n歌もダンスも、まずは、覚えないと。", "zh": "前提是要能把这首歌唱好吧，\n要先把歌曲和舞蹈都记起来才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1023_015siz", "source_sha256": "bb9e1cfd0f61094bdd0df3e5c2911d8c837929b423f7ace9d7cd56299487c201", "ja": "そうねっ。{$P$}。\nレッスンルーム、今空いてますか？", "zh": "说得对！{$P$}，\n练习室现在空着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "72a543e896309eebae52bfbfa0b11fd469d56e5e85dc29a86249d17c6dd9fecd", "ja": "ちょっと待っててくれ。ええと……。", "zh": "先等一下，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1025_015siz", "source_sha256": "13296ca6b9bb2cc35404adaf786e2507cd21c0cb6471809bc863c68ef4f0b705", "ja": "あ、空いてなければ、それはそれでいいです。\n公園とかでもレッスンはできますし。", "zh": "啊，要是有人在用也无所谓，\n毕竟在公园之类的也能练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1026_020meg", "source_sha256": "04a8c4e197cbf0849cdfa937246e756b3a2d3950885692077d79aea423d6e603", "ja": "にゃはは♪　いいね～静香っ。\nアタシも付き合っちゃおうかな～♪", "zh": "呀哈哈♪不错嘛～静香。\n我也一起练习好了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1027_051tmg", "source_sha256": "9baa20c2b5bdc1c18c8404fb00ccbf4b6dfaa767ecaecb47b56d40cbd59caff3", "ja": "わ、私も参加させてもらえますか。\nとにかく、できるだけ早く練習……せんと……。", "zh": "请、请问可以让我一起加入吗？\n总之，要尽早开始练习……才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1028_020meg", "source_sha256": "864b88804dc9c29f6eb90b1856c9b747ef7b139f1e4c72d3060a30cccb8006c6", "ja": "つ～むぎ？　緊張しない緊張しない！\nまずはアタシ達が楽しまないと、ね♪", "zh": "䌷～？别紧张别紧张！\n我们要先乐在其中才行，好吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1029_051tmg", "source_sha256": "44626664e2d2d55d5c04fcda22cd0bcc6ccd92fcb957a7cf744128af28bbb9ed", "ja": "ひゃうっ！　と、所さん！？\nそんな、く、くすぐったいです……っ！", "zh": "呀呜！是、是所吗！？\n这样好、好痒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "efa19f04bacd6af5e2e27a47a24b88594bbfb920dac544cddff005649faac466", "ja": "みんな、プレッシャーに負けてないみたいだな。\nこの調子で、Fairyみんなで力を合わせ……。", "zh": "看来大家没有被压力击垮呢，\n就像这样，由Fairy的成员同心协力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_1031", "source_sha256": "df550a350ff8b3f5b5be9b1ea4907990e475d62c0de5b5c03929aa3af535f3d7", "ja": "公演を成功させてくれ", "zh": "让公演圆满成功吧", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "d0d2651ba59fef5494f2b9a2feb2adb6566491134abec861443a9064b1f1a600", "ja": "公演を成功させてくれ！", "zh": "让公演圆满成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_2001_051tmg", "source_sha256": "76fa5382d51cec4fa597000ddfc160defb1eef9dbf9a2bdcbcbe6648df017c1d", "ja": "っ！　すべて人任せにするおつもりなのですか！？", "zh": "……！请问你是打算把责任全都丢给别人吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_2002_p", "source_sha256": "def3011a751bd79c9fbc492828c4ddf6610a812b89ee6aa4454e8e1f38b0719f", "ja": "あ、いや、そうじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊，不是的，不是这样……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_2003", "source_sha256": "195cb61fea525b2ca2abd283d0f8b9112ebec2bf8fb5126e2d04417c1385f2c8", "ja": "公演を成功させよう", "zh": "一起让公演圆满成功", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_3000_p", "source_sha256": "a479474e74d1ee4b0bc91c48b9ad432b2ec649fc53a7ac639d686685debbee4b", "ja": "公演を成功させよう！　俺と一緒に！", "zh": "和我一起让公演圆满成功吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_3001_015siz", "source_sha256": "e301bb91ca0e579060141d8de88b722b1d2badd68a46f9d79c10c373f05569e9", "ja": "プッ……、コホン。紬さん、ありがとうございます。\n{$P$}、しっかりお願いしますね。", "zh": "呵……咳咳，䌷，谢谢你。\n{$P$}，那就请多指教了喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_3002_020meg", "source_sha256": "382b34b8973355468d4496c939a73e753293d32fd1b195df6054a91a22c1d2d5", "ja": "そうだよ～、よろしくねっ♪", "zh": "对喔～请多指教啰♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0011_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0011_story_01_3003_p", "source_sha256": "4307010ebb1e26ae5adb7701992eee13a30bda3aa4b7b092e1c41adac7e1beed", "ja": "（メンバー発表だけで、信頼を失うところだった……。\nFairyチームのお披露目公演、必ず成功させよう！）", "zh": "（差点在公布成员的时候就失去信赖了……\n一定要让Fairy队的首次亮相公演成功！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
